        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "106. The wage scales set forth are intended to constitute minimum scales only and nothing in this Agreement shall preclude the Employer from paying in excess of such minimum rates at the Employer's discretion. However, no employee-covered by this Agreement shall, as a result of the provisions of this Agreement, suffer a reduction in his/her wage rate so long as he/she continues in the same classification except as results from the application of Article X.",
            "block_bbox": [
