        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "108. Pay days.now.in effect shall continue and there.shall he no more lapse of time between wages earned and wages paid than as results from operation of the present system. The Employer may place any employee on a weekly payroll without the permission of the Union. Any employee who terminates shall receive all wages due him/her as provided in the State Labor Code. The Employer will in good faith attempt to distribute pay checks to the employees on their normal work shifts on pay days.",
